zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\\\"/>\\n                        </svg>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div class=\\\"flex-1\\\">\\n                        <p class=\\\"font-medium\\\">Резервное копирование завершено</p>\\n                        <p class=\\\"text-sm text-gray-400\\\">Все данные успешно сохранены</p>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <span class=\\\"text-xs text-gray-400\\\">1 час назад</span>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-xl hover:bg-white/10 transition cursor-pointer\\\">\\n                    <div class=\\\"p-2 bg-purple-500/20\" }} />\n  );\n}\n",
